4%2F0a%2Ff2dcdf0e47f39edb8dd104c77bf3%2F0d911e41-ce8d-439e-9bf6-80406e37e678.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F34%2F0a%2Ff2dcdf0e47f39edb8dd104c77bf3%2F0d911e41-ce8d-439e-9bf6-80406e37e678.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F34%2F0a%2Ff2dcdf0e47f39edb8dd104c77bf3%2F0d911e41-ce8d-439e-9bf6-80406e37e678.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3000x1688+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2F34%2F0a%2Ff2dcdf0e47f39edb8dd104c77bf3%2F0d911e41-ce8d-439e-9bf6-80406e37e678.jpg" class="img" alt="" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 "Weird Al" Yankovic                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Getty Images/Bob Riha Jr.                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out what &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/sections/culture/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NPR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is watching, reading and listening to this weekend:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍿 Movies:&lt;/strong&gt; The holiday season is packed full of can't-miss films. These are &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/26/nx-s1-6010507/17-films-to-see-before-new-years-from-oscar-bait-to-blockbusters" target="_blank"&gt;17 movies that you should see&lt;/a&gt; before the year ends.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; 📺 TV: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Parks and Recreation&lt;/em&gt; star Amy Poehler and creator Michael Schur reunite for &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/24/nx-s1-6050256/youll-dig-amy-poehlers-dig" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dig&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, an ensemble comedy about a team of archaeologists caught up in a series of mysterious events after uncovering an ancient artifact in Greece.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📚 Books:&lt;/strong&gt; Why settle for one book recommendation when you can get more than 300? Now's the time to browse this year's &lt;a href="https://apps.npr.org/best-books/#view=covers&amp;year=2026" target="_blank"&gt;Books We Love&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎵 Music:&lt;/strong&gt; NPR Music's Stephen Thompson and Lars Gotrich join host &lt;em&gt;All Songs Considered&lt;/em&gt; Robin Hilton to attempt to build a canon of music for giving thanks, spending time with loved ones and, of course, celebrating food. &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/24/nx-s1-6051062/songs-for-gluttony-and-gratitude-a-thanksgiving-playlist" target="_blank"&gt;Check out their playlist here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;🍴&lt;strong&gt; Food: &lt;/strong&gt;A few years ago, Israeli American chef Alon Shaya spearheaded the Rescue Recipes initiative at the United States Holocaust Memorial Museum, exploring food's role in World War II. He has &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/26/nx-s1-6028781/memories-of-a-good-meal-cookbook-chef-alon-shaya" target="_blank"&gt;compiled his stories and dishes&lt;/a&gt; in a new cookbook, &lt;em&gt;Memories of a Good Meal: Recipes of Resilience Inspired by Stories of World War II Survival.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-155974" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4670;         --source-height: 2627;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4670x2627+0+243/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Ff1%2F58%2Fa5ad2fbe4885be94763f638069b5%2Faz3y1564-1.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4670x2627+0+243/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Ff1%2F58%2Fa5ad2fbe4885be94763f638069b5%2Faz3y1564-1.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4670x2627+0+243/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Ff1%2F58%2Fa5ad2fbe4885be94763f638069b5%2Faz3y1564-1.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4670x2627+0+243/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Ff1%2F58%2Fa5ad2fbe4885be94763f638069b5%2Faz3y1564-1.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4670x2627+0+243/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-production-npr.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com%2Fbrightspot%2Ff1%2F58%2Fa5ad2fbe4885be94763f638069b5%2Faz3y1564-1.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspot