&lt;/em&gt;focuses on kindness.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Sesame Workshop                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Parents of young children say they're worried about a &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/23/nx-s1-6035702/kindness-kids-sesame-street-parents-survey" target="_blank"&gt;perceived decline in kindness&lt;/a&gt; and they now value empathy over manners and compassion over confidence, according to a Sesame Workshop survey.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A near-record number of travelers are set to hit the roads this Thanksgiving week. They'll face &lt;a href="http://npr.org/2026/11/23/nx-s1-6042357/fuel-is-expensive-this-year-how-will-that-affect-thanksgiving-travel" target="_blank"&gt;higher costs due to elevated fuel prices&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Has a political or social issue damaged an important relationship for you? If you're thinking about repairing it this holiday season, NPR wants to &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/23/g-s1-155085/holidays-relationships-politics-dispute" target="_blank"&gt;hear your story&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/859721331/suzanne-nuyen"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Suzanne Nuyen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
