      <description>&lt;div id="storytext" class="storytext storylocation linkLocation"&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Good morning. You're reading the Up First newsletter. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/newsletter/news" target="_blank"&gt;Subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; here to get it delivered to your inbox, and &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/podcasts/510318/up-first/" target="_blank"&gt;listen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; to the Up First podcast for all the news you need to start your day.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Today's top stories&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A technology issue with United Airlines delayed departing flights yesterday evening&lt;/strong&gt;, just as air travel was returning to normal after the Federal Aviation Administration ordered a &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/14/nx-s1-6040952/faa-ground-stop-airplane-travel" target="_blank"&gt;nationwide ground stop&lt;/a&gt; on Friday. President Trump said yesterday that he hopes this incident will prompt Congress to allocate more funds to upgrade the outdated air traffic control system.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-153744" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 8091;         --source-height: 4551;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8091x4551+0+421/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9e%2F96%2Fe23d590f45f8bbd605875a794fb7%2Fgettyimages-2304485779.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8091x4551+0+421/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9e%2F96%2Fe23d590f45f8bbd605875a794fb7%2Fgettyimages-2304485779.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/8091x4551+0+421/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp